{"page":197,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:62","surah":9,"ayah":62,"ar_uthmani":"يَحْلِفُونَ بِٱللَّهِ لَكُمْ لِيُرْضُوكُمْ وَٱللَّهُ وَرَسُولُهُۥٓ أَحَقُّ أَن يُرْضُوهُ إِن كَانُوا۟ مُؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They swear by God in order to please you [believers]: if they were true believers it would be more fitting for them to please God and His Messenger.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَحْلِفُونَ","en_gloss":"They swear","transliteration":"yaḥlifūna","verse_key":"9:62"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"by Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"9:62"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"9:62"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِيُرْضُوكُمْ","en_gloss":"to please you","transliteration":"liyur'ḍūkum","verse_key":"9:62"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"9:62"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَرَسُولُهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūluhu","verse_key":"9:62"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَحَقُّ","en_gloss":"(have) more right","transliteration":"aḥaqqu","verse_key":"9:62"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"9:62"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُرْضُوهُ","en_gloss":"they should please Him","transliteration":"yur'ḍūhu","verse_key":"9:62"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"9:62"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they are","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"9:62"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"believers","transliteration":"mu'minīna","verse_key":"9:62"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٦٢","en_gloss":"(62)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:62"}]},{"verse_key":"9:63","surah":9,"ayah":63,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ يَعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّهُۥ مَن يُحَادِدِ ٱللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُۥ فَأَنَّ لَهُۥ نَارَ جَهَنَّمَ خَـٰلِدًا فِيهَا ۚ ذَٰلِكَ ٱلْخِزْىُ ٱلْعَظِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do they not know that whoever opposes God and His Messenger will go to the Fire of Hell and stay there? That is the supreme disgrace.","wo