ut what you fear!’-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَحْذَرُ","en_gloss":"Fear","transliteration":"yaḥdharu","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقُونَ","en_gloss":"the hypocrites","transliteration":"l-munāfiqūna","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"lest","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تُنَزَّلَ","en_gloss":"be revealed","transliteration":"tunazzala","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"about them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":6,"ar":"سُورَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"a Surah","transliteration":"sūratun","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تُنَبِّئُهُم","en_gloss":"informing them","transliteration":"tunabbi-uhum","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قُلُوبِهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbihim","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قُلِ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"quli","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱسْتَهْزِءُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"Mock","transliteration":"is'tahziū","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مُخْرِجٌۭ","en_gloss":"(will) bring forth","transliteration":"mukh'rijun","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":17,"ar":"تَحْذَرُونَ","en_gloss":"you fear","transliteration":"taḥdharūna","verse_key":"9:64"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٦٤","en_gloss":"(64)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:64"}]},{"verse_key":"9:65","surah":9,"ayah":65,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَئِن سَأَلْتَهُمْ لَيَقُولُنَّ إِنَّمَا كُنَّا نَخُوضُ وَنَلْعَبُ ۚ قُلْ أَبِٱللَّهِ وَءَايَـٰتِهِۦ وَرَسُولِهِۦ كُنتُمْ تَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"yet if you were to question them, they would be sure to say, ‘We were just chatting, just amusing ourselves.’ Say, ‘Were you making jokes about God, His Revelations, and His Mes-senger?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَئِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wala-in","verse_key":"9:65"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سَأَلْتَهُمْ","en_gloss":"you ask them","transliteration":"sa-altahum","verse_key":"9:65"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَيَقُولُنَّ","en_gloss":"surely they will say","transliteration":"layaqūlunna","verse_key":"9:65"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"9:65"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كُنَّا","en_gloss":"we were","transliteration":"kunnā","verse_key":"9:65"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نَخُوضُ","en_gloss":"conversing","transliteration":"nakhūḍu","verse_key":"9:65"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَنَلْعَبُ ۚ","en_gloss":"and playing","transliteration":"wanalʿabu","verse_key":"9:65"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"9:65"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَبِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Is it Allah","transliteration":"abil-lahi","verse_key":"9:65"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَءَايَـٰتِهِۦ","en_gloss":"and His Verses","transliteration":"waāyātihi","verse_key":"9:65"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūlihi","verse_key":"9:65"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"(that) you were","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"9:65"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","en_gloss":"mocking","transliteration":"tastahziūna","verse_key":"9:65"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٦٥","en_gloss":"(65)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:65"}]},{"verse_key":"9:66","surah":9,"ayah":66,"ar_uthmani":"لَا تَعْتَذِرُوا۟ قَدْ كَفَرْتُم بَعْدَ إِيمَـٰنِكُمْ ۚ إِن نَّعْفُ عَن طَآئِفَةٍ مِّنكُمْ نُعَذِّبْ طَآئِفَةًۢ بِأَنَّهُمْ كَانُوا۟ مُجْرِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do not try to justify yourselves; you have gone from belief to disbelief.’ We may forgive some of you, but We will punish others: they are evildoers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"9:66"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَعْتَذِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"make excuse","transliteration":"taʿtadhirū","verse_key":"9:66"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"verily","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"9:66"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَفَرْتُم","en_gloss":"you have disbelieved","transliteration":"kafartum","verse_key":"9:66"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَعْدَ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿda","verse_key":"9:66"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِيمَـٰنِكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"your belief","transliteration":"īmānikum","verse_key":"9:66"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"9:66"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نَّعْفُ","en_gloss":"We pardon","transliteration":"naʿfu","verse_key":"9:66"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"[on]","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"9:66"},{"pos":10,"ar":"طَآئِفَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"a party","transliteration":"ṭāifatin","verse_key":"9:66"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِّنكُمْ","en_gloss":"of you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"9:66"},{"pos":12,"ar":"نُعَذِّبْ","en_gloss":"We will punish","transliteration":"nuʿadhib","verse_key":"9:66"},{"pos":13,"ar":"طَآئِفَةًۢ","en_gloss":"a party","transliteration":"ṭāifatan","verse_key":"9:66"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"because they","transliteration":"bi-annahum","verse_key":"9:66"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"were","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"9:66"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مُجْرِمِينَ","en_gloss":"criminals","transliteration":"muj'rimīna","verse_key":"9:66"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٦٦","en_gloss":"(66)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:66"}]},{"verse_key":"9:67","surah":9,"ayah":67,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقُونَ وَٱلْمُنَـٰفِقَـٰتُ بَعْضُهُم مِّنۢ بَعْضٍ ۚ يَأْمُرُونَ بِٱلْمُنكَرِ وَيَنْهَوْنَ عَنِ ٱلْمَعْرُوفِ وَيَقْبِضُونَ أَيْدِيَهُمْ ۚ نَسُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ فَنَسِيَهُمْ ۗ إِنَّ ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ هُمُ ٱلْفَـٰسِقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The hypocrites, both men and women, are all the same: they order what is wrong and forbid what is right; they are tight-fisted. They have ignored God, so He has ignored them. The hypocrites are the disobedient ones.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقُونَ","en_gloss":"The hypocrite men","transliteration":"al-munāfiqūna","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَٱلْمُنَـٰفِقَـٰتُ","en_gloss":"and the hypocrite women","transliteration":"wal-munāfiqātu","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بَعْضُهُم","en_gloss":"some of them","transliteration":"baʿḍuhum","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّنۢ","en_gloss":"(are) of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَعْضٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"others","transliteration":"baʿḍin","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَأْمُرُونَ","en_gloss":"They enjoin","transliteration":"yamurūna","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِٱلْمُنكَرِ","en_gloss":"the wrong","transliteration":"bil-munkari","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَيَنْهَوْنَ","en_gloss":"and forbid","transliteration":"wayanhawna","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْمَعْرُوفِ","en_gloss":"(is) the right","transliteration":"l-maʿrūfi","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَيَقْبِضُونَ","en_gloss":"and they close","transliteration":"wayaqbiḍūna","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَيْدِيَهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"their hands","transliteration":"aydiyahum","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":13,"ar":"نَسُوا۟","en_gloss":"They forget","transliteration":"nasū","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَنَسِيَهُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"so He has forgotten them","transliteration":"fanasiyahum","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ","en_gloss":"the hypocrites","transliteration":"l-munāfiqīna","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":18,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"they (are)","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلْفَـٰسِقُونَ","en_gloss":"the defiantly disobedient","transliteration":"l-fāsiqūna","verse_key":"9:67"},{"pos":20,"ar":"٦٧","en_gloss":"(67)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:67"}]},{"verse_key":"9:68","surah":9,"ayah":68,"ar_uthmani":"وَعَدَ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ وَٱلْمُنَـٰفِقَـٰتِ وَٱلْكُفَّارَ نَارَ جَهَنَّمَ خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَا ۚ هِىَ حَسْبُهُمْ ۚ وَلَعَنَهُمُ ٱللَّهُ ۖ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ مُّقِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God promises the Fire of Hell as a permanent home for the hypocrites, both men and women, and the disbelievers: this is enough for them. God rejects them and a lasting punishment awaits them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَعَدَ","en_gloss":"Allah has promised","transliteration":"waʿada","verse_key":"9:68"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has promised","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:68"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ","en_gloss":"the hypocrite men","transliteration":"l-munāfiqīna","verse_key":"9:68"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْمُنَـٰفِقَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"and the hypocrite women","transliteration":"wal-munāfiqāti","verse_key":"9:68"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلْكُفَّارَ","en_gloss":"and the disbelievers","transliteration":"wal-kufāra","verse_key":"9:68"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نَارَ","en_gloss":"Fire","transliteration":"nāra","verse_key":"9:68"},{"pos":7,"ar":"جَهَنَّمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Hell","transliteration":"jahannama","verse_key":"9:68"},{"pos":8,"ar":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","en_gloss":"they (will) abide forever","transliteration":"khālidīna","verse_key":"9:68"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِيهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"9:68"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هِىَ","en_gloss":"It (is)","transliteration":"hiya","verse_key":"9:68"},{"pos":11,"ar":"حَسْبُهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"sufficient for them","transliteration":"ḥasbuhum","verse_key":"9:68"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَلَعَنَهُمُ","en_gloss":"And Allah has cursed them","transliteration":"walaʿanahumu","verse_key":"9:68"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۖ","en_gloss":"And Allah has cursed them","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:68"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَلَهُم